  exp(4) \<Omega\>(i+1)^2 \<Omega\>(i)>; neutral coin is
  <verbatim|2m\<twosuperior\> header\<twosuperior\>/(u
  L_i)>.>>|<row|<cell|Terminal packet>|<cell|private
  <verbatim|YM.RG08.Flat.at_end>; <verbatim|YM.RG08.Flat.turn_class>;
