  <verbatim|Packets/Present.lean>; <verbatim|Packets/FlatStep.lean>>|<cell|Difference
  of the two terminal saddle kernels; strip bounds give folded cost
  <verbatim|m(\<Omega\>+\<Omega\>)>; floor zero-mode and root identities give
  neutrality and the tested curvature representation.>>|<row|<cell|One-step
  predecessor>|<cell|private <verbatim|YM.RG08.Flat.to_here>;
