  <verbatim|Packets/FlatStep.lean>>|<cell|Push the finer neutral packet
  through the two actual response kernels; Schur identity gives the precision
  difference and <verbatim|push_null> gives exactly <verbatim|neutralCoin *
  previous cost>.>>|<row|<cell|Actual response atlas
  bounds>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Pert.Bulk.atlas_here>;
  <verbatim|YM.Pert.Bulk.values>; <verbatim|YM.Pert.Bulk.birth>>|<cell|<verbatim|Pert/Bulk/Keys.lean>>|<cell|<verbatim|priced_atlas>
  from deep tower cost and adjacent row bounds; enlarging
  <verbatim|exp(4\<omega\>)> to <verbatim|exp(4)> gives the displayed header;
  diagonal/crossing identities match the carrier maps.>>|<row|<cell|Response
  translation and travel>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.RG08.Packets.pass_response>;
  <verbatim|YM.RG08.Flat.travels_route>; <verbatim|.travels_duo>;
